{"code":"134060","name":"이퓨쳐","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"교육서비스","sector_desc":"학원·온라인 교육·교재. 학령 인구와 교육 정책 변화에 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 2000년 인터넷교육컨텐츠 및 소프트웨어 개발을 목적으로 설립되어 2011년 코스닥에 상장된 중소기업임. ELT 관련 영어 컨텐츠 개발 및 도서 출판업을 주요사업으로 영위하며, 2003년 EFL Phonics 출시로 ELT 시장에 진입함. 20여년간 영어교육경험을 바탕으로 글로벌 유아 초등용 영어컨텐츠를 개발하고, AI기술 접목 ELT 컨텐츠 및 SMARTREE 등을 공급하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-16","n_days":300,"close":5490.0,"open":5480.0,"high":5490.0,"low":5430.0,"volume":1798,"amount":9871020.0,"ret_1d":5.1724,"gap":4.9808,"range_pct":1.0929,"ret_5":0.9191,"ret_20":-0.1818,"ret_60":15.0943,"ret_120":29.1765,"ret_250":24.9147,"ma20":5420.5,"ma60":5276.6667,"ma120":4833.4167,"ma200":4540.8,"close_vs_ma200":20.9038,"close_vs_ma60":4.043,"ma_align":1,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":78.8062,"r2_60":0.5788,"slope_120":105.8999,"r2_120":0.7628,"slope_250":29.755,"r2_250":0.4655,"high52":5790.0,"low52":3530.0,"pos_52w":86.7257,"dd_52w":-5.1813,"mdd_1y":-25.2298,"atr14_pct":4.2545,"vol_ann_60":36.3283,"vol_avg20":2670.5,"vol_ratio20":0.6733,"vr5":0.5939,"vr20":0.255,"amount_avg5":15203468.0,"amount_avg20":14441096.5,"amount_avg60":22801318.0833,"obv_chg20":-12.5239,"turnover_20":1.1199,"pv_eff_20":-0.1624,"rsi14":53.2183,"frgn_net_5":-1257.0,"inst_net_5":13261.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0264,"inst_net_5_pct":0.2781,"smart_net_5_pct":0.2517,"frgn_net_20":-11962.0,"inst_net_20":41708.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.2508,"inst_net_20_pct":0.8745,"smart_net_20_pct":0.6237,"frgn_net_60":-7735.0,"inst_net_60":165034.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.1622,"inst_net_60_pct":3.4604,"smart_net_60_pct":3.2982,"frgn_net_120":-16010.0,"inst_net_120":496785.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.3357,"inst_net_120_pct":10.4164,"smart_net_120_pct":10.0807,"foreign_ratio":0.9,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.17,"smart_buy_streak":12,"op_income_q":-2.0,"op_margin_q":-7.6923,"op_qoq":-300.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-300.0,"rev_yoy":0.0,"op_trend_4q":-20.0,"fin_period":"202606","roe":8.02,"debt_ratio":21.36,"per":14.52,"pbr":0.87,"div_yield":4.55,"for